          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>FUTR was built on a simple belief: every growing athlete deserves nutrition made specifically for them. Not borrowed from adult formulas. Not watered down. </p><p>Every product is developed around the way youngathletes actually train, compete, recover, and grow —purposeful, and science-backed.</p>",
