          }
        },
        "image_and_text_x8Mccy": {
          "type": "image_and_text",
          "settings": {
            "grid_image_size": "square",
            "heading": "TIM ZIEGENFUSS",
            "text": "<p>PH.D., FISSN, CSCS<br/>Chief Science Officer </p>",
            "bio_text": "<p>Dr. Tim Ziegenfuss leads the science and product formulation behind FUTR. He holds a Ph.D. in Exercise Physiology, with advanced academic training in nutrition and statistics, and has spent decades studying how nutrition, physical activity, and dietary ingredients affect human health and performance.</p><p>An internationally recognized researcher, author, and sports nutrition expert, Dr. Ziegenfuss has published more than 80 scientific papers, contributed to eight book chapters, and helped develop nutrition products used by athletes around the world. He is a former university professor, a past President and Fellow of the International Society of Sports Nutrition, and a Certified Strength and Conditioning Specialist.</p><p>At FUTR, Dr. Ziegenfuss oversees ingredient selection, formula development, and scientific review. His role is to ensure every formula has a clear purpose and is grounded in credible research, appropriate dosing, and the real nutritional needs of developing young athletes.</p>",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_text": ""
          }
        },
